# A token declared uniform integer, given a float literal in an array of
# one. Before the parser consulted the declared type, this stored the float
# bits and read back as garbage instead of failing; it now must raise
# RIE_SYNTAX ("Non-integer in array.") the same way an out-of-place float
# already does inside a genuine integer array.
#
# A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
# desync convention."
Declare "myint" "uniform integer"
Display "malformed_out.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Surface "plastic" "myint" [4.0]
Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
WorldEnd
